  "duration_s": 158.150998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了？领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了，来就来带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。哎呀，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，今天让你破费了，领导饭钱是小事儿，能跟您单独请教一次。这顿对我来说是投资，真会说话来，这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。李总饭在哪儿？我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了，坐吧，我们再点两个菜，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本说的恰到好处，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，新都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我欲解心开呀。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 330,
      "end_ms": 1670,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2390,
      "end_ms": 3170,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4530,
      "end_ms": 4910,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4910,
      "end_ms": 5810,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9630,
      "end_ms": 10850,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11170,
      "end_ms": 12510,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13070,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14850,
      "end_ms": 16090,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19350,
      "end_ms": 20530,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21330,
      "end_ms": 22570,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22850,
      "end_ms": 23810,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23890,
      "end_ms": 24970,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27730,
      "end_ms": 28490,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28690,
      "end_ms": 29390,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29610,
      "end_ms": 29985,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30240,
      "end_ms": 30980,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31100,
      "end_ms": 33180,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33260,
      "end_ms": 34740,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34900,
      "end_ms": 36280,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37600,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38400,
      "end_ms": 39280,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39520,
      "end_ms": 41080,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41180,
      "end_ms": 42640,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 42660,
      "end_ms": 43660,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 43860,
      "end_ms": 45740,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47000,
      "end_ms": 48140,
      "text": "怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 49820,
      "text": "我刚种的花就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 50420,
      "end_ms": 51500,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 51580,
      "end_ms": 53100,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 53280,
      "end_ms": 55140,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57100,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "来就来带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58880,
      "end_ms": 59760,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60150,
      "end_ms": 60370,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60370,
      "end_ms": 61010,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 61010,
      "end_ms": 61670,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61790,
      "end_ms": 63305,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 63570,
      "end_ms": 66305,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 67220,
      "end_ms": 68465,
      "text": "今天让你破费了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 68960,
      "end_ms": 70455,
      "text": "领导饭钱是小事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70860,
      "end_ms": 72545,
      "text": "能跟您单独请教一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 72870,
      "end_ms": 74330,
      "text": "这顿对我来说是投资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 75930,
      "end_ms": 77330,
      "text": "真会说话来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 77330,
      "end_ms": 79145,
      "text": "这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 79370,
      "end_ms": 80250,
      "text": "李总饭在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 80250,
      "end_ms": 80750,
      "text": "我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 80950,
      "end_ms": 82710,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82710,
      "end_ms": 84125,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 85260,
      "end_ms": 85740,
      "text": "坐吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85960,
      "end_ms": 87115,
      "text": "我们再点两个菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87460,
      "end_ms": 88900,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88920,
      "end_ms": 89835,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90220,
      "end_ms": 92600,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 92860,
      "end_ms": 94500,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 94580,
      "end_ms": 96400,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 96420,
      "end_ms": 97480,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 97580,
      "end_ms": 98300,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 98360,
      "end_ms": 99200,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 99320,
      "end_ms": 100515,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 100880,
      "end_ms": 103140,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103260,
      "end_ms": 105525,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105820,
      "end_ms": 107000,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 107180,
      "end_ms": 108540,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 108760,
      "end_ms": 111445,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 111680,
      "end_ms": 112940,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 113020,
      "end_ms": 113935,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 114230,
      "end_ms": 114370,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 114370,
      "end_ms": 116370,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 116570,
      "end_ms": 117335,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 117810,
      "end_ms": 118770,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 118830,
      "end_ms": 120195,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 120520,
      "end_ms": 122140,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 122240,
      "end_ms": 123940,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 125155,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 125410,
      "end_ms": 128360,
      "text": "新都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 128440,
      "end_ms": 129600,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 129820,
      "end_ms": 131105,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 131400,
      "end_ms": 132785,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 133070,
      "end_ms": 134455,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 134720,
      "end_ms": 136000,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 136080,
      "end_ms": 137755,
      "text": "这个真是让我欲解心开呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 138120,
      "end_ms": 139435,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 139760,
      "end_ms": 142240,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 142260,
      "end_ms": 142980,
      "text": "应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 143220,
      "end_ms": 145885,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 146160,
      "end_ms": 147525,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 147880,
      "end_ms": 149220,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_72981e8ccac3d4d8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 149460,
      "end_ms": 151995,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
